config ST7701S
	bool "Sitronix ST7701S MIPI-DSI panel"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_SITRONIX_ST7701S_ENABLED
	select MIPI_DSI
	help
	  Enable driver for the Sitronix ST7701S MIPI-DSI panel.  The active
	  resolution is taken from the devicetree width/height properties.
	  The init sequence is tuned for the target 480x800 panel module.

	  The panel initialises at CONFIG_APPLICATION_INIT_PRIORITY, after both
	  the MIPI-DSI host and the LCDC controller, so mipi_dsi_attach() finds a
	  ready host and the host switches the link to video once the panel has
	  issued its display-on.
